- reviewer_disposed = true prevents the retry path (reason = retry_missing_reviewer) if the spawn failed
- dispose_reviewers_for_pr races with the new reviewer's worktree creation

Fix: when head_sha_changed = true, skip adding to reviewer_disposals regardless of terminal_review_observed — the old reviewer was already disposed in a prior cycle, and adding the PR to disposals again in the same cycle as the spawn creates the race. Gate the disposal push on !head_sha_changed:

    if terminal_review_observed && !head_sha_changed {
        if let Some(ws) = state_guard.get_mut(pr_number) {
            if !ws.reviewer_disposed {
                reviewer_disposals.push(*pr_number);
                ws.reviewer_disposed = true;
            }
        }
    }

