## Problem

The watcher runs as a background tokio task inside exomonad serve. Its logs go to the Server window mixed with all other server output (dominated by orphan reconciler noise). There is no dedicated visible pane for watcher activity, making it impossible to observe PR polling state at a glance.

## Design

The Watcher window is a session-level service window — not an agent, not a companion, not subject to the orphan reconciler. It is created unconditionally during init alongside Server and TL. It tails .exo/logs/watcher.log (written by issue #370 changes).

